@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontColor #000000
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam ComponentBorderColor #000000
skinparam ComponentFontColor #000000
skinparam RectangleBorderColor #000000
skinparam RectangleFontColor #000000
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #000000
skinparam DatabaseFontColor #000000

title Product Management Flow Before Autonomous Engine

actor "LLM / Agent" as Agent #E8F0FE
component "MCP Server\nTool Router" as Server #D9EAD3
component "Linear Template Service\n(create/apply/list templates)" as LinearWrapper #D0E0FF
component "GitHub App Service\n(create issues + PRs)" as GitHubWrapper #FCE5CD
component "Template Enforcer\n(section validation)" as Template #FFF4CC
database "Linear API" as LinearApi #EAF7EA
database "GitHub REST API" as GitHubApi #FFE5E5
rectangle "Manual Product Review\nstale work, cycle fit,\nnext-cycle vetting" as Manual #F3F3F3

Agent --> Server : call focused wrapper tools
Server --> LinearWrapper : Linear issue operations
Server --> GitHubWrapper : GitHub issue/PR operations
LinearWrapper --> Template : validate Linear body
GitHubWrapper --> Template : validate GitHub body
LinearWrapper --> LinearApi : create/update/list
GitHubWrapper --> GitHubApi : create/list repositories
Agent --> Manual : separate reasoning outside server

note bottom of Manual #FFFDEB
The server can create well-formed issues,
but stale detection, cycle governance,
and proactive product signal vetting
are not first-class server behavior.
end note

@enduml
